ext{b) Zapiši enačbo tangente na graf funkcije } f, 	ext{ ki je pravokotna na graf funkcije } g.

positive_text:
Let $n \ge 3$ be an integer, and consider a set of $n$ points in three-dimensional space such that:
(i) each pair of distinct points is joined by a segment assigned one of four distinct labels: red, green, blue, or yellow;
(ii) for any three distinct points, if the three segments connecting them are not monochromatic, then they must each have distinct labels;
(iii) it is not the case that all segments have the same label.
Determine the largest possible value of $n$.

negatives.text:
Let $n \ge 3$ be an integer, and consider a set of $n$ points in three-dimensional space such that:
(i) every two distinct points are connected by a string which is either red, green, blue, or yellow;
(ii) for every three distinct points, if the three strings between them are not all of the same colour, then at least two are of the same colour;
(iii) not all the strings have the same colour.
Find the maximum possible value of $n$.

Let $n \ge 3$ be an integer, and consider a set of $n$ points in three-dimensional space such that:
(i) every two distinct points are connected by a string which is either red, green, blue, or yellow;
(ii) for every three distinct points, if the three strings between them are not all of the same colour, then they are of two or three different colours;
(iii) not all the strings have the same colour.
Find the maximum possible value of $n$.

positive_text:
Für die reellen Zahlen $x$, $y$, $z$, $w$ gelten die Gleichungen
$$
\begin{array}{ll}
x=\sqrt{45-\sqrt{21-x}}, & y=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21-y}} \\
z=\sqrt{45-\sqrt{21+z}}, & w=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21+w}}
\end{array}
$$
Zeige, dass gilt $x y z w=2004$.

negatives.text:
Für die reellen Zahlen $a$, $b$, $c$, $d$ gelten die Gleichungen
$$
\begin{array}{ll}
a=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21-a}}, & b=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21-b}} \\
c=\sqrt{45-\sqrt{21+c}}, & d=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21+d}}
\end{array}
$$
Zeige, dass gilt $a b c d=2004$.

Für die reellen Zahlen $a$, $b$, $c$, $d$ gelten die Gleichungen
$$
\begin{array}{ll}
a=\sqrt{45-\sqrt{21-a}}, & b=\sqrt{45+\sqrt{21-b}} \\
c=\sqrt{45-\sqrt{21+c}}, & d=\sqrt{46+\sqrt{21+d}}
\end{array}
$$
Zeige, dass gilt $a b c d=2004$.

