\text{Let } b_{1}, b_{2}, \ldots, b_{2013} \text{ be real numbers satisfying the following conditions:}
- b_{1} = b_{2013} = 0
- |b_{i} - b_{i+1}| < 1 \text{ for } 1 \leq i \leq 2012.
- \sum_{i=1}^{2013} b_{i} = 0.
\text{Find the maximum value of } \sum_{i=1}^{k} b_{i} \text{ where } k (1 \leq k \leq 2013) \text{ is variable, and the sequence } \{b_{i}\} \text{ is to be chosen.}

